cal B\\times\\mathcal B\\)</span>。这些是八元依赖谓词原有的长度函数、末模型函数、候选域及比较关系，不对它们作存在闭包。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span>，参数顺序为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd)\">\\((M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComparisonProcess}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ComparisonProcess}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> 是在上述固定环境内定义的三元谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ComparisonProcess}_S(\\mathcal C,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S(M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\n\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}comparison\\text{-}process}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ComparisonProcess}_S(\\mathcal C,M,N)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathcal C=\\langle\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U\\rangle\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcInner4ComparisonProcess}_S(M,N,\\mathcal T,\\mathcal U,\n\\ell,\\operatorname{Last},\\mathcal B,\\unlhd)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","loca